WEBVTT

00:00:00.653 --> 00:00:02.653
Step 1: Navigate to the collaborative AI editor app

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.660
Step 2: Fill in the display name field with a test name

00:00:02.329 --> 00:00:06.013
Step 3: Open the Apple workspace

00:00:06.013 --> 00:00:10.054
Step 4: Click the New note button to create a new note

00:00:10.054 --> 00:00:15.739
Step 5: Type sample content into the editor surface of the newly created note

00:00:15.739 --> 00:00:20.359
Step 6: Delete the currently selected note
